This file covers Rx8025t.h/Rx8025t.cpp in this directory, which are adapted
from https://github.com/45gfg9/RTClib (the RX8025T driver only — timekeeping
and VLF/power-loss detection; alarms, timer, RAM and other chips from that
library were not carried over), renamed to avoid a build-time filename
collision with adafruit/RTClib (both projects ship a header named RTClib.h,
and this project already depends on adafruit/RTClib elsewhere — notably
lib/MeshCore/src/helpers/AutoDiscoverRTCClock.cpp, for its DS3231/PCF8563
support — so the two cannot occupy the same include path under the same name).
